  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes. Drain.\n• Return saucepan to medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook ginger paste until fragrant, 1 minute. Return cooked rice to pan and stir to combine. Season to taste. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64db047040948d4c6070795d-0a7e2241.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook Asian stir-fry mix, tossing, until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl. Season and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64db047040948d4c6070795d-7fb21d66.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are cooking, cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, soy sauce mix, sesame seeds and remaining garlic paste.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64db047040948d4c6070795d-61bcf960.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide ginger rice between bowls.\n• Top with garlicky veggies and sweet chilli tofu.\n• Garnish with crispy shallots. Serve with a dollop of mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64db047040948d4c6070795d-e9f9f691.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
